e DOW contract, because starshield resides on STARLINK and Zelenskyy has now violated the Starlink TOS\n\nAnd if Z wants to get out of \"CHECK\" he can REVISE HIS WHINING and say \"oh sorry, I was wrong, it was ONLY STARSHIELD\" and then he can bitch to DOW\n\nBut Musk should still BAN ALL STARLINK IN UKRAINE\n\nI dont' care WHO it hurts\n\nBan it\n\nBan it now\n\nThis is not Elon Musk's WAR\n\nTHIS IS NOT ELON MUSKS WAR\n\nTHIS IS NOT OUR WAR\n\nWE DID NOT ASK FOR THIS WAR\n\nAND ELON HAS ENOUGH MONEY\n\nIF HE LOSES MONEY I WILL HELP PAY FOR THE MONEY THAT UKRAINE GENERATES FOR STARLINK\n\n---\n***I WILL PAY FOR ONE UKRAINE ACCOUNT TO BE INACTIVE\u2e3bDo you understand?  I will pay another 140 a month to block a ukranian from getting internet via starlink.  They can find another way***\n\n---\nEnough people do this, and Elon won't have to soul harvest Ukraine", "author": "5DchessWatch", "created": 1794849813417, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "mikethemarine", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "CHECKMATE:  Zelenskyy is whining to Musk and DOW that his drone speed is capped, but he has admitted he doesn't know if it's starlink or starshield (a military subset of starlink) that's controlling his drones.  Bascially, that's ADMITTING he VIOLATED the Starlink TOS to have armed drones", "last_comment_created": 1794862756520, "content": "<p>Using armed drones is a violation of starlink, so if Ukraine doesn't know whether starlink or starshield is controlling his armed drones, he's admitting to a violation of starlink's terms of service (because it means its using both or either)!!!</p>\n<p>CHECKMATE MOTHER FUCKER.</p>\n<p>Either ADMIT that it's starshield controlling your armed drones and whine to DOW, or lose ALL ACCESS to both STARLINK AND STARSHIELD for TOS violation</p>\n<p>I just checked with AI, and this is not a defense production act contract.  This is Elon Musks normal DOW contract.</p>\n<p>Musk could not proceed with ripping up the DOW contract, because starshield resides on STARLINK and Zelenskyy has now violated the Starlink TOS</p>\n<p>And if Z wants to get out of &quot;CHECK&quot; he can REVISE HIS WHINING and say &quot;oh sorry, I was wrong, it was ONLY STARSHIELD&quot; and then he can bitch to DOW</p>\n<p>But Musk should still BAN ALL STARLINK IN UKRAINE</p>\n<p>I dont' care WHO it hurts</p>\n<p>Ban it</p>\n<p>Ban it now</p>\n<p>This is not Elon Musk's WAR</p>\n<p>THIS IS NOT ELON MUSKS WAR</p>\n<p>THIS IS NOT OUR WAR</p>\n<p>WE DID NOT ASK FOR THIS WAR</p>\n<p>AND ELON HAS ENOUGH MONEY</p>\n<p>IF HE LOSES MONEY I WILL HELP PAY FOR THE MONEY THAT UKRAINE GENERATES FOR STARLINK</p>\n<hr />\n<p><em><strong>I WILL PAY FOR ONE UKRAINE ACCOUNT TO BE INACTIVE\u2e3bDo you understand?  I will pay another 140 a month to block a ukranian from getting internet via starlink.  They can find another way</strong></em></p>\n<hr />\n<p>Enough people do this, and Elon won't have to soul harvest Ukraine</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 4, "score_up": 183, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0STUPID\u00a0\u00a0S.O.B.\u00a0\u00a0", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "2122173484415492546", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1AToiJjzzs", "is_twitter": true, "is_admin": false, "score": 261, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8942228, "raw_content": "", "author": "CyanScales", "created": 1794842796277, "profi